WEBVTT

00:48:29.746 --> 00:48:34.663
accidental misuse of a system and
intentional misuse of a system.

00:48:35.871 --> 00:48:40.496
So like intentional would be a bad actor
saying, I've got this powerful system,

00:48:40.496 --> 00:48:43.079
I'm going to use it to like hack into
all the computers in the world

00:48:43.079 --> 00:48:44.829
and wreak havoc on the power grids.

00:48:45.496 --> 00:48:50.663
And accidental would be kind of the Nick
Bostrom make a lot of paper clips

00:48:50.663 --> 00:48:55.038
and view humans as collateral
damage in both cases.

00:48:55.038 --> 00:48:58.579
But to varying degrees, if
we can really, truly,

00:48:59.413 --> 00:49:02.663
technically solve the alignment
problem and